// Outputs are arranged by kanshi, not here. It matches a monitor by make,
// model and serial, so the Acer stays to the left of the panel whichever
// connector the dock assigns it. The profiles are in bootstrap/files/kanshi/
// and are installed by 111-kanshi.ts.
//
// With no profile applied — kanshi not running yet, or no monitor pair it
// knows — niri places outputs itself, so a broken kanshi costs the arrangement
// and not the session.
